      "speakerId": "organizer",
      "speaker": "活动负责人",
      "turnId": "t002",
      "text": "I've been put in charge of food for the city football team's holiday party next week, and I don't know where to start."
    },
    {
      "id": "s003",
      "start": 11.72,
      "end": 13.59,
      "speakerId": "advisor",
      "speaker": "同事",
      "turnId": "t003",
      "text": "How many people will be there?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s004",
      "start": 13.59,
      "end": 14.88,
      "speakerId": "organizer",
      "speaker": "活动负责人",
      "turnId": "t004",
      "text": "Around 40."
    },
    {
      "id": "s005",
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 16.87,
      "speakerId": "advisor",
      "speaker": "同事",
      "turnId": "t005",
      "text": "That's a big group."
    },
    {
      "id": "s006",
      "start": 16.87,
      "end": 24.13,
      "speakerId": "advisor",
      "speaker": "同事",
      "turnId": "t005",
      "text": "The first thing you need to do is find out people's likes and dislikes and see if anyone has any dietary restrictions."
    },
    {
      "id": "s007",
      "start": 24.13,
      "end": 25.66,
      "speakerId": "organizer",
      "speaker": "活动负责人",
      "turnId": "t006",
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "id": "s008",
      "start": 25.66,
      "end": 27.48,
      "speakerId": "organizer",
      "speaker": "活动负责人",
      "turnId": "t006",
      "text": "How do I go about it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s009",
      "start": 27.48,
      "end": 30.6,
      "speakerId": "advisor",
      "speaker": "同事",
      "turnId": "t007",
      "text": "Just write up a little questionnaire and send it to everyone."
    },
    {
      "id": "s010",
      "start": 30.6,
      "end": 35.54,
      "speakerId": "advisor",
      "speaker": "同事",
      "turnId": "t007",
      "text": "Then, based on the responses, write up a menu and go shopping."
    },
    {
      "id": "s011",
      "start": 35.54,
      "end": 36.37,
      "speakerId": "organizer",
      "speaker": "活动负责人",
      "turnId": "t008",
      "text": "Nice."
    },
    {
      "id": "s012",
      "start": 36.37,
      "end": 38.0,
      "speakerId": "organizer",
      "speaker": "活动负责人",
      "turnId": "t008",
      "text": "I'll work on that now."
